Dil Maang Raha Hai Guitar Chords with strumming pattern sung by Yasser Desai from Bollywood Hindi movie Ghost.

Strumming Pattern: D D DUDUD

Capo on: 1st Fret

Dil [Am]maang raha hai mohalat,        Tere saath dhadakne [G]ki
Tere naam se jeene [F]ki,        Tere naam se marne [E]ki

[Am] Dil maang raha hai mohalat,        Tere saath dhadakne [G]ki
Tere naam se jeene [F]ki,        Tere naam se marne [E]ki

Tere [Am]sang chalun hardam,        Bankar ke parchaa [G]yi
Ik baar ijaazat [F]de,        Mujhe tujhme dhalne [Em]ki

De [Am]kha hai jab se [G]tumko,        Mai [F]ne ye jaana [G]hai
Mere [Dm]khwahish ke [Em]shehar mein,        Bas [F]tera thikana [Am]hai

Main [Am]bhool gaya khud [G]ko bhi,        Bas [F]yaad raha ab [Em]tu
Aa [Dm]teri hatheli [Em]pe,        Iss [F]dil ko main rakh [Am]doon

Dil [Am]bol raha hai hasrat,        Har hadh se guzarne [G]ki
Tere naam se jeene [F]ki,        Tere naam se marne [Em]ki

Dil [Am]maang raha hai mohalat,        Tere saath dhadakne [G]ki
Tere naam se jeene [F]ki,        Tere naam se marne [E]ki

[Am]O o o o oo o oo [G]o o [F]o,        O o [Em]o
